{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"waitForReady"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This method provides a modern async\/await interface for waiting until Airship","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"has finished initializing. It’s particularly useful when you need to ensure","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Airship is ready before performing operations that depend on it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Usage","level":2,"text":"Usage","type":"heading"},{"code":["\/\/ Wait for Airship to be ready","await Airship.waitForReady()","","\/\/ Now safe to use Airship components","Airship.push.enableUserNotifications()"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Behavior","level":2,"text":"Behavior","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If Airship is already initialized (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isFlying"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":"), this method returns immediately","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If Airship is not yet initialized, this method suspends until initialization completes","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The method will not throw or fail - it simply waits for the ready state","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method must be called from the main thread."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Note","type":"aside"},{"style":"important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This method assumes ","type":"text"},{"code":"Airship.takeOff","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has been called. If ","type":"text"},{"code":"takeOff","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is never called, this method will suspend indefinitely.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Important","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.urbanairship.AirshipCore\/documentation\/AirshipCore\/Airship\/waitForReady()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"waitForReady()","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"waitForReady","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"}],"externalID":"s:11AirshipCore0A0C12waitForReadyyyYaFZ","modules":[{"name":"AirshipCore"}],"extendedModule":"AirshipCore","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Type Method"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Waits for Airship to be ready using async\/await."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/airshipcore\/airship\/waitforready()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.urbanairship.AirshipCore\/documentation\/AirshipCore","doc:\/\/com.urbanairship.AirshipCore\/documentation\/AirshipCore\/Airship"]]},"references":{"doc://com.urbanairship.AirshipCore/documentation/AirshipCore/Airship/waitForReady()":{"url":"\/documentation\/airshipcore\/airship\/waitforready()","title":"waitForReady()","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.urbanairship.AirshipCore\/documentation\/AirshipCore\/Airship\/waitForReady()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Waits for Airship to be ready using async\/await."}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[